# {{projectName}}

Apache Camel integration generated by [FlowCamel](https://github.com/flowcamel/flowcamel).

## Prerequisites

- Java 21+

## Run locally

```bash
chmod +x mvnw   # Unix/macOS only, first time
./mvnw spring-boot:run
```

On Windows:

```cmd
mvnw.cmd spring-boot:run
```

The app loads routes from `src/main/resources/camel/routes.camel.yaml`.

## Build

```bash
./mvnw clean package
java -jar target/{{artifactId}}-1.0.0-SNAPSHOT.jar
```

## Optional infrastructure

If your flow uses Kafka or ActiveMQ, start dependencies first:

```bash
docker compose up -d
```

Then run the application as above.

## Project layout

| Path | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `pom.xml` | Maven build (Camel {{camelVersion}}, Spring Boot 3) |
| `mvnw` / `mvnw.cmd` | Maven Wrapper (no global Maven install required) |
| `src/main/resources/camel/routes.camel.yaml` | Camel YAML DSL routes |
| `src/main/resources/application.yml` | Spring Boot / Camel configuration |
| `docker-compose.yml` | Local Kafka / ActiveMQ (when used by the flow) |
